		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπάορος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀείρω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hanging on high, far distant,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστέρες οὔτε τι πολλὸν ἀ. οὔτε μάλ᾽
